## all-evaluations-failed.soar -- selection-world: 1 elaboration, 5 proposals, 1 application.

## ---- elaborations ----

## Elaborate selection all-evaluations-failed too-many.
sp {selection-world*elaborate*selection*all-evaluations-failed*too-many
   :default
   (state <s> ^name selection
              ^item-count { > 6 <n> }
             -^top-selection true
              ^remaining-operators 0)
-->
   (write (crlf) |WARNING: tie of | <n> | operators; all-evaluations-failed is only checked for up to 6.|)}

## ---- operator proposal ----

## Propose all-eval.
sp {selection-world*propose*selection*all-evaluations-failed2
   :default
   (state <s> ^name selection
              ^item-count 2
              ^evaluation <evaluation1> { < <evaluation1> <evaluation2> }
             -^top-selection true
              ^remaining-operators 0)
   (<evaluation1> ^symbolic-value failure)
   (<evaluation2> ^symbolic-value failure)
-->
   (<s> ^operator <operator> + =, >)
   (<operator> ^name all-evaluations-failed)
}

